    {
      "id": "c3b369fd936b4e1ab7bb87882bab7385",
      "component_kind": "process_flow",
      "title": "Automated Corrugator Paper Reel Feeding System",
      "body": "Automated Corrugator Paper Reel Feeding System",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "Text",
          "body": "Automated Corrugator Paper Reel Feeding System\n\nINGETRANS is a complete automated solution for managing paper reel supply to multiple consumption points on the corrugator, including the automatic return of unused, or partially used, reels to their assigned storage locations. Designed and manufactured by Ingecart, this system eliminates forklift dependency, reduces accident risks, and significantly improves operational efficiency.\n\nThe KEY 👉 \nWith the available operational data, a clear conclusion emerges:\n the real bottleneck is not the travel speed of the forklift,\nbut the availability, synchronization, \nand coordination of reel supply. \nINGETRANS delivers its value not by moving faster,\n but by transforming reel handling into a continuous, predictable, and automated process. \nThis results in fewer supply interruptions, \nimproved corrugator availability, higher OEE, enhanced operational safety, and a more stable and efficient logistics flow throughout the plant."
        },
        {
          "title": "Title",
          "body": "INTRALOGISTICS INGETRANS"
        }
      ],
      "props": {
        "layout": "two-column"
      },
      "asset_ids": [],
