      "id": "3444dbe85c2f436093650fce176218b2",
      "component_kind": "process_flow",
      "title": "Intelligent Internal Logistics for the Entire Corrugated Plant",
      "body": "Intelligent Internal Logistics for the Entire Corrugated Plant",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "Text",
          "body": "Intelligent Internal Logistics for the Entire Corrugated Plant\n\nTransform every internal material movement into an autonomous,\n intelligent and fully connected logistics ecosystem.\nOur AMR Platform automates not only WIP management, \nbut also waste handling, production supplies, \npackaging materials and auxiliary logistics,\ncreating a unified intralogistics infrastructure for the entire plant.\n\nOne Platform. Multiple Material Flows.\n\nA single fleet of autonomous mobile robots manages every internal logistics process across the plant.\nInstead of deploying dedicated transport systems for each application, one intelligent AMR fleet dynamically executes multiple missions according to real-time production priorities."
        },
        {
          "title": "Heading",
          "body": "Ingecart Intralogistics Management System \nIntralogistics"
        }
      ],
      "props": {
        "layout": "two-column"
      },
